WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:03.167
-Welcome back, everybody! I'm here with Michael Strahan!

00:00:03.167 --> 00:00:07.033
We're about to play shoe golf!

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:08.267
-Okay.

00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:09.734
-Now, this is just like regular golf,

00:00:09.734 --> 00:00:11.834
but instead of using a club to hit your ball into the hole,

00:00:11.834 --> 00:00:15.267
you're gonna use your foot to kick your shoe into a bucket.

00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:17.334
And we're gonna play three holes.

00:00:17.334 --> 00:00:18.868
Lowest score wins. You ready for this?

00:00:18.868 --> 00:00:20.334
-I'm ready. -Alright, let's go, bud.

00:00:20.334 --> 00:00:22.267
-But I did notice you wore heavier shoes to get --

00:00:22.267 --> 00:00:24.501
-Oh, are you talking about these jams?

00:00:24.501 --> 00:00:25.901
-But it's all good. It's all good.

00:00:25.901 --> 00:00:27.267
-Alright. We're going to start at hole number one.

00:00:27.267 --> 00:00:28.334
Let's hop in. I'll drive.

00:00:28.334 --> 00:00:29.734
-Alright. -Yeah.

00:00:29.734 --> 00:00:33.634
Thanks again. This is fun. I love to play shoe golf.

00:00:33.634 --> 00:00:35.734
Alright. I'm not a good driver.

00:00:35.734 --> 00:00:37.567
-What is -- Whoa. -I know.

00:00:37.567 --> 00:00:39.133
I was going a little fast here. Hey.

00:00:39.133 --> 00:00:40.868
[ Cheers and applause ] Alright, here we go.

00:00:40.868 --> 00:00:43.067
-Alright. -I know. I'm a bad driver.

00:00:43.067 --> 00:00:44.467
Alright. Good. Now we can get out.

00:00:44.467 --> 00:00:48.868
Alright. All the way over here. This is hole number one.

00:00:48.868 --> 00:00:50.300
-Okay. -So we have to go down there.

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:52.868
I think there's a gentleman down there waiting with two beers.

00:00:52.868 --> 00:00:55.100
Whoever gets the lowest score on this one gets a beer.

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:56.634
-Alright. So who's going to go first?

00:00:56.634 --> 00:00:58.801
-You go, bud. -Okay.

00:00:58.801 --> 00:01:01.267
-This is the tee box.

00:01:01.267 --> 00:01:03.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:03.067 --> 00:01:05.501
-Okay.

00:01:05.501 --> 00:01:07.000
-There's a bunch of deer.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.734
You got to watch out for the deer.

00:01:09.734 --> 00:01:11.968
Ooh! [ Laughter ]

00:01:11.968 --> 00:01:14.567
Alright. Oops.

00:01:14.567 --> 00:01:16.200
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:17.534
-Alright. Here we go.

00:01:17.534 --> 00:01:19.701
-Thank goodness the ceiling panels are metal.

00:01:19.701 --> 00:01:21.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.367 --> 00:01:22.567
-That one -- I think NBC is mad.

00:01:22.567 --> 00:01:23.734
-So you got to make it in the bucket, right?

00:01:23.734 --> 00:01:24.968
-Alright. You got to get it in the bucket.

00:01:24.968 --> 00:01:26.300
-I've gotta get out of your way. You look --

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:30.000
-Ready? On my way.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:31.501
-Ohh!

00:01:31.501 --> 00:01:33.334
[ Audience ohhs ]

00:01:33.334 --> 00:01:35.167
-Almost got the j--

00:01:35.167 --> 00:01:37.734
Whoo! Looks like you're away, bud.

00:01:37.734 --> 00:01:39.667
-I'm a little away.

00:01:39.667 --> 00:01:42.267
-Hee hee hee, hee!

00:01:42.267 --> 00:01:43.968
I think I might have it.

00:01:43.968 --> 00:01:46.234
Aw. Dang. It's like that.

00:01:46.234 --> 00:01:48.100
-Let me get that out of there.

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:50.734
-Yeah, that's the same thing, right? Alright.

00:01:50.734 --> 00:01:53.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.701 --> 00:01:56.400
-You almost missed it.

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:58.634
-[Irish accent] You guys want a little beer? You worked really hard.

00:01:58.634 --> 00:01:59.968
-Thank you very much. I like the terrible accent.

00:01:59.968 --> 00:02:01.901
-Oh, it's the best one yet. -Thank you. Here we go.

00:02:01.901 --> 00:02:03.734
Alright, so here we have to go through --

00:02:03.734 --> 00:02:07.000
There's crocodiles in the water. And there's cactus over there.

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:08.734
-Cacti. -Cactis.

00:02:08.734 --> 00:02:10.000
You can go first.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:11.767
[ Bossa nova music plays ]

00:02:11.767 --> 00:02:14.334
♪♪

00:02:14.334 --> 00:02:16.467
Not bad. Here we go.

00:02:16.467 --> 00:02:22.868
♪♪

00:02:22.868 --> 00:02:25.400
-Whoa! Whoa! -That's a new move.

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:28.334
-That right there is what you call a worm burner.

00:02:28.334 --> 00:02:29.734
You didn't mean to do that.

00:02:29.734 --> 00:02:31.400
-I didn't mean to do it, but it looked great, though.

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:34.367
Look at that. -If I make this...

00:02:34.367 --> 00:02:38.234
-You'll be the shoe-golf champ.

00:02:38.234 --> 00:02:41.334
Ooh! That's a little finesse on that one.

00:02:41.334 --> 00:02:43.200
But watch this jam right here.

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:46.434
Come on. You know what's up, dude.

00:02:46.434 --> 00:02:47.667
-Boo!

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:49.000
-Ohh!

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:50.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:50.701 --> 00:02:52.701
That's a gimme. That's a gimme. That's a gimme.

00:02:52.701 --> 00:02:54.901
Alright. Here we go. What are you doing?

00:02:54.901 --> 00:02:57.133
-Because I'm everywhere. I'm everywhere.

00:02:57.133 --> 00:02:58.834
-What are you doing back here? -You want a freshie.

00:02:58.834 --> 00:03:00.267
-No, we're done with your character.

00:03:00.267 --> 00:03:02.267
What is going on? Thank you very much.

00:03:02.267 --> 00:03:03.701
Who is that guy? -Very good.

00:03:03.701 --> 00:03:06.868
-Thank you very much. -So, hold on. I'm down one.

00:03:06.868 --> 00:03:09.200
-You got to win this one. This is a windstorm right here.

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:11.634
And there's Hashtag the Panda down there.

00:03:11.634 --> 00:03:13.400
Giant wind machine here. There's a lot of birds.

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:14.767
Here we go.

00:03:17.267 --> 00:03:20.634
Hey! Dude, the panda hit my shot out of the air.

00:03:20.634 --> 00:03:22.501
-Hey, Panda! -Hey, Panda.

00:03:22.501 --> 00:03:25.901
-You touch this thing, I'm gonna go Tom Brady on you.

00:03:25.901 --> 00:03:28.701
♪♪

00:03:28.701 --> 00:03:30.634
-Be careful.

00:03:30.634 --> 00:03:33.000
Hashtag, we're just gonna go around you, okay?

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:35.133
Thank you.

00:03:35.133 --> 00:03:37.167
-What you doing, Panda?!

00:03:37.167 --> 00:03:40.801
-Dude, Panda got you. Dude, not bad.

00:03:40.801 --> 00:03:42.300
Good job, bud.

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:43.934
-Fore!

00:03:43.934 --> 00:03:48.868
♪♪

00:03:48.868 --> 00:03:51.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:53.400
♪♪

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:57.167
-Alright. Big shot, Jimmy. What you got? Big shot!

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:01.701
-Ohh!

00:04:01.701 --> 00:04:06.434
♪♪

00:04:06.434 --> 00:04:08.534
-[ Laughs ] I think I know how this is going to end.

00:04:08.534 --> 00:04:10.200
I think I know how this is going to end.

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:12.100
That almost went in there. -I'll be honest with you, man.

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:14.267
This is not the music I listen to when I play golf.

00:04:14.267 --> 00:04:15.834
[ Laughter ]

00:04:15.834 --> 00:04:17.701
-It's the music I listen to.

00:04:17.701 --> 00:04:19.901
♪♪

00:04:19.901 --> 00:04:21.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:21.367 --> 00:04:22.968
[ Bell dinging ]

00:04:22.968 --> 00:04:25.501
♪♪

00:04:25.501 --> 00:04:27.567
-Hey, I thought the winner

00:04:27.567 --> 00:04:29.801
was supposed to drink the beer out of the shoe.

00:04:29.801 --> 00:04:31.200
-That's what I thought, too, yeah.

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:33.934
[ Cheers and applause ] That's what I --

00:04:33.934 --> 00:04:36.267
♪♪

00:04:36.267 --> 00:04:38.367
-Did I just win? -Yeah, you just won.

00:04:38.367 --> 00:04:40.334
-Yeah. -I forfeited.

00:04:40.334 --> 00:04:42.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:48.734
♪♪

00:04:48.734 --> 00:04:50.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:50.667 --> 00:04:54.701
♪♪

00:04:54.701 --> 00:04:57.701
Yes! Yes! -My thanks to Michael Strahan!

00:04:57.701 --> 00:05:01.734
Check out "100,000 Pyramid" Saturdays at 9:00 p.m. on ABC.

